[{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0001","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0001.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"致远 OA NCFindWeb 接口本地文件包含漏洞","description":"致远互联 OA 系统的 NCFindWeb 接口存在本地文件包含漏洞（CWE-22），远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向 /NCFindWeb?service=IPreAlertConfigService&filename=WEB-INF/web.xml 路径发送特制的 GET 请求，利用 filename 参数读取服务器上任意文件，导致 web.xml 等敏感配置文件泄露。攻击者可进一步利用泄露的信息扩大攻击面，危害严重。攻击条件低，无需任何权限认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-VULNERABILITIES-SEEYON-WOOYUN-2015-148227-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-08-01","updated":"2015-08-01","remediation":"立即升级致远 OA 至官方最新版本（A6+ / A8+ 最新安全补丁包）；如无法升级，在 Nginx/WAF 层添加规则拦截 `/NCFindWeb?service=` 路径请求，对 `filename` 参数做路径白名单校验，禁止包含 `../` 等目录遍历字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wooyun.x10sec.org/static/bugs/wooyun-2015-0148227.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0025","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-3224","title":"Ruby on Rails Web Console 白名单绕过漏洞","description":"Ruby on Rails Web Console（web-console）组件在 2.1.3 之前版本中存在访问控制绕过漏洞。该组件在处理客户端 IP 地址时未正确限制 X-Forwarded-For 请求头的使用，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求伪造 IP 地址，从而绕过 whitelisted_ips 白名单 IP 保护机制，在未经授权的情况下访问 Web Console 交互式控制台界面。成功利用后，攻击者可在 Rails 应用上下文中执行任意 Ruby 代码，导致敏感信息泄露或服务器被完全控制。攻击无需身份认证，但需要目标启用 Web Console 且攻击者能构造包含恶意 X-Forwarded-For 头的 HTTP 请求。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-3224"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-07-26T22:59:03.023","updated":"2026-06-17T00:25:34.343","remediation":"将 web-console gem 升级至 2.1.3 或更高版本：在 Gemfile 中指定 `gem 'web-console', '>= 2.1.3'`，然后执行 `bundle update web-console` 并重启 Rails 应用。如无法立即升级，可在生产环境配置 `config.consider_all_requests_local = false` 禁用 Web Console，或通过反向代理/Nginx 规则限制对 `/console` 路径的外部来源访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-June/160881.html","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2015/06/16/18","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75237","https://github.com/rails/web-console/blob/master/CHANGELOG.markdown","https://groups.google.com/forum/message/raw?msg=rubyonrails-security/lzmz9_ijUFw/HBMPi4zp5NAJ","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41689","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3224.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-3224.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2015/CVE-2015-3224.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3224.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2015/CVE-2015-3224/cve-2015-3224.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/76729d36853c2b419aa6a67b7435e9a2c529ac8e/data/2015/CVE-2015-3224-n000xy_CVE-2015-3224-.md","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/a065f3c765e12d5989e4cfc616d3f15b9c0f99ef/advisories/_posts/2015-06-16-CVE-2015-3224.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-3224","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2015-3224.yaml","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/e8fb8c8d4f5de912b7778f3aec7367ca61a10f66/2015/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-3224.rules","https://github.com/0xEval/cve-2015-3224","https://github.com/0x00-0x00/CVE-2015-3224","https://github.com/SQU4NCH/CVE-2015-3224","https://github.com/roriruri9370/Whitelist-bypass","https://github.com/n000xy/CVE-2015-3224-"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0023","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2863","title":"Kaseya Virtual System Administrator 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Kaseya Virtual System Administrator（VSA）存在开放重定向漏洞。攻击者可构造特制URL，通过未充分验证的用户输入参数将用户重定向至任意外部网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击窃取敏感信息。该漏洞影响Kaseya VSA 7.x至9.1系列多个版本，攻击复杂度中等，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS评分4.3。厂商已在7.0.0.29、8.0.0.18、9.0.0.14及9.1.0.4版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2863"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-07-20T23:59:01.940","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:53.237","remediation":"立即升级 Kaseya VSA 至以下修复版本：V7.x 升级至 7.0.0.29，R8.x 升级至 8.0.0.18，R9.0 升级至 9.0.0.14，R9.1 升级至 9.1.0.4。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或反向代理层配置规则，拦截包含可疑重定向参数的请求，并对所有外部跳转目标进行白名单校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/919604","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37621","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2863.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2863.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2863.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2863.json","https://github.com/pedrib/PoC/blob/3d8e58284be35d1893dbba8a7d33c27ed9e88352/advisories/Kaseya/kaseya-vsa-vuln.txt","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-2863_3.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3de20c94a6acc7eef50db49f637eef233d97be21/2015/CVE-2015-2863.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/13e17ac40c12fcaa921f27e9c8534f670bd0f2c1/plugins/kaseya/virtual_system_administrator/CVE-2015-2863.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-2863_6.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-2863_4.yaml","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/94493d4ecd186c002eb46ccc1bf2f9abf99f720a/reports/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2863.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0309","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2426","title":"Microsoft Windows OpenType Font Driver 缓冲区下溢远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Adobe Type Manager Library (atmfd.dll) 存在缓冲区下溢漏洞，远程攻击者可构造恶意 OpenType 字体文件，诱导用户打开包含该字体的文档或网页，触发缓冲区下溢导致远程代码执行。影响范围覆盖 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Windows Server 2012/R2 及 Windows RT/8.1 等版本。攻击条件为需用户交互（打开恶意字体文件），攻击向量为网络，无需权限，成功利用可获取系统完整控制权限（CVSS 8.8 HIGH）。Microsoft 已在 MS15-078 安全公告中发布补丁修复该漏洞，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2426"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-07-20T18:59:01.210","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:05.220","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS15-078 (KB3079904) 提供的安全更新，受影响系统包括 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Windows Server 2012/R2、Windows RT 8.1。通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update 目录手动下载对应系统版本的补丁包安装。无法立即打补丁的系统，可暂时禁用 ATMFD.DLL 字体驱动作为缓解：以管理员权限运行命令 \"ren %windir%\\system32\\atmfd.dll atmfd.dll.bak\" 并重启系统（会导致 OpenType 字体无法渲染），或通过组策略禁用 \"Windows 字体缓存服务\" 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.trendmicro.com/trendlabs-security-intelligence/a-look-at-the-open-type-font-manager-vulnerability-from-the-hacking-team-leak/","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/103336","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75951","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032991","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-078","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38222/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2426","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2426.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4c8bc08999fabe8b3294f538c2b18b89d913b674/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2426.json","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules_index.yar","https://github.com/EmergingThreats/et-luajit-scripts/blob/109d050f5593e629311d0ca92d3200f59d57a7c8/CVE-2015-2426.lua","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/a23585d6e0a4a5091377e3865a13acb8fdeff3df/modules/exploits/windows/local/ms15_078_atmfd_bof.rb","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2426","https://github.com/OlivierLaflamme/Cheatsheet-God/blob/b879fd62eaae297b38087b8227dde5f8f0cf7668/Cheatsheet_Windows.txt","https://github.com/mishamyrt/Lilex/blob/7cc1be8832a2e6363edb733ee7a8b2a503f99b43/SECURITY.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-2426-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-2426/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0408","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2590","title":"Oracle Java SE 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE Libraries 组件存在未明确类型的任意代码执行漏洞（CVE-2015-2590），攻击者可通过构造恶意 Java 应用程序或 Applet，利用 Java SE Libraries 组件中的未明确漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Oracle Java SE 7u80 及之前版本、Java SE 8u45 及之前版本，攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含恶意 Java Applet 的网页，或通过部署恶意 Java Web Start 应用程序，诱导用户加载并执行恶意代码，从而在用户权限下执行任意代码，完全控制受害系统。Red Hat 将该漏洞评级为 Critical（严重），CVSS 评分较高。Oracle 已在 2015 年 7 月的关键补丁更新（CPU）中修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至 Java SE 7u85、Java SE 8u51 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2590"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-07-16","updated":"2015-07-16","remediation":"立即升级 Oracle Java SE 至 2015 年 7 月 CPU 修复版本：Java SE 6 升级至 6u95 及以上、Java SE 7 升级至 7u80 及以上、Java SE 8 升级至 8u45 及以上；Java SE Embedded 7 升级至 7u75 及以上、Java SE Embedded 8 升级至 8u33 及以上。通过 java.com 下载最新版或在 Windows/Mac 上启用 Java 自动更新。若暂时无法升级，请在浏览器中禁用 Java 插件（Java Applet 和 Java Web Start），并在防火墙层面限制非受信网络访问 Java RMI/JRMP 端口（默认 1099、4444 等）作为临时缓解措施。此漏洞已被列入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录，必须优先修补。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2590.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2590","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-2590-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-2590/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2015/CVE-2015-2590.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-2590.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-2590.html","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2015-2590","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2015-2590.json","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/theregister_oracle_java_patch.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0222","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2387","title":"Microsoft Windows 权限提升漏洞","description":"这是一个针对 Microsoft Windows Server 的严重权限提升漏洞，源于 Adobe Type Manager Font 驱动程序中的整数溢出或缓冲区溢出。攻击者通过构建包含恶意字体数据的精细控制的应用程序，并以低权限本地用户身份执行，可以触发 ATMFD.DLL 模块的严重内存损坏。在本地访问权限的情况下，攻击无需用户交互即可直接利用这种漏洞，导致远程代码执行并获得系统管理员级别的权限。该漏洞影响 Windows Server 2003 SP2、Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2 和 R2 SP1、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2012 Gold 和 R2 以及 Windows RT Gold 和 8.1 等多个 Windows Server 版本。成功攻击后，攻击者可以完全控制受影响系统，读取敏感数据、修改系统文件或破坏系统服务，造成严重安全威胁。该漏洞被评定为 CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8 的 HIGH 级别，代表了该漏洞的严重性和潜在影响。Microsoft 已经在 2015 年 8 月的累积更新中发布了安全补丁，修复了此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2387"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-07-14T22:59:08.103","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:01.693","remediation":"建议立即安装微软2015年7月安全更新MS15-077（KB3079904），通过Windows Update自动更新或手动下载对应系统版本补丁包安装。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表禁用ATMFD.DLL字体驱动作为临时缓解：在注册表HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Windows中将ATMFD.DLL值数据清空并重启系统，或通过组件服务禁用\"Windows Font Cache Service\"服务作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至Windows 10或更高版本以获得长期支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75587","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032908","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA15-195A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-077","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2387","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2387.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2015-2387/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2387","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2015/CVE-2015-2387.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-2387-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2015-2387/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-2387.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-2387.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2015-2387.json","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/113866.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0308","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2425","title":"微软 Internet Explorer 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 11 存在内存破坏漏洞（CVE-2015-2425），属于越界写入类型（CWE-787）。攻击者通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，利用 IE 11 内存管理缺陷触发内存破坏，可导致远程代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 IE 11 浏览器，CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限但需要用户交互，影响机密性、完整性和可用性均为高。该漏洞不同于 CVE-2015-2383 和 CVE-2015-2384，已被列入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录，Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复。攻击者需诱导受害者访问精心构造的恶意网站即可触发漏洞，实现远程代码执行或导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2425"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-07-14T21:59:36.813","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:05.047","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2015 年 7 月安全更新 MS15-065 (KB3065822)，通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装对应 IE 11 补丁（Windows 7 SP1/Server 2008 R2 对应 KB3065822，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 对应 KB3065820，Windows 10 对应 KB3074683）。无法立即打补丁时，可暂时禁用 IE 的 VBScript 脚本引擎（通过组件服务禁用 VBScript.dll 注册）或改用 Chrome/Firefox 等替代浏览器作为临时缓解措施，并部署网络层 IPS 规则拦截针对 IE 内存破坏的攻击载荷特征。建议尽快完成全网补丁部署并验证补丁安装状态（检查注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall\\ 下对应 KB 编号）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032894","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-065","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2425","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2425.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4c8bc08999fabe8b3294f538c2b18b89d913b674/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2425.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2425","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-2425/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-2425.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-2425.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-2425.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2015.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2384.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/798a31226c5b1d5c9cc61c5fe52f04996d380b21/data_single/2015/CVE-2015-2425.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0306","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2424","title":"微软 Office 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 多个版本存在内存破坏漏洞（CWE-787 越界写入），攻击者可通过诱导用户打开精心构造的恶意 Office 文档（如 PowerPoint 或 Word 文件），触发内存损坏从而在目标系统上远程执行任意代码或导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Microsoft PowerPoint 2007 SP3、Word 2007 SP3、PowerPoint 2010 SP2、Word 2010 SP2、PowerPoint 2013 SP1、Word 2013 SP1 及 PowerPoint 2013 RT SP1 等多个版本。攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限但需要用户交互（打开文档），成功利用可导致系统机密性、完整性和可用性均遭到高度破坏（CVSS 8.8 HIGH）。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议立即安装微软发布的安全更新（MS15-070）或升级至 Office 2016 及以上版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2424"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-07-14T21:59:35.987","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:04.850","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft Office 2007/2010/2013 的安全更新，包括 2015 年 7 月和 8 月的累积更新，或升级到 Office 2016 及以上版本。如需紧急修复，可在注册表中禁用 Office 的外部实体解析功能，并禁止从互联网下载未经签名的 OLE 对象作为临时缓解措施","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032899","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-070","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2424","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2424.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/SSVC/data/2015/CVE-2015-2424.json","https://github.com/eset/malware-ioc/blob/812c573dc8c354210893775b2de97d1fbf29be1b/sednit/part1.adoc","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2424","https://github.com/decalage2/oletools/blob/ec10260989dbc48b9109e3d05d22beee19cf2333/oletools/common/clsid.py","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-2424/README.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-2424.html","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2015.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2015/CVE-2015-2424.json","https://github.com/cuckoosandbox/community/blob/14864b9fa2ba2576ca11887caf37616eaec6d941/modules/signatures/windows/office.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0300","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2419","title":"微软 Internet Explorer JavaScript远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 10 和 11 中的 JScript 9 脚本引擎存在内存损坏漏洞。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的网页，诱使用户使用受影响版本的 IE 浏览器访问该页面，从而触发 JScript 9 内存操作越界，导致远程代码执行或应用程序拒绝服务。该漏洞利用无需用户交互即可在浏览器进程中执行任意代码，并可进一步获取系统权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2419"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-07-14T21:59:33.283","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:04.143","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2015 年 7 月安全更新 MS15-065（KB3065822），运行 IE10 或 IE11 的系统还需额外安装 KB3075516。更新可通过 Windows Update 自动获取，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即更新，可在注册表或组策略中禁用 JScript 引擎，并限制 Internet Explorer 访问外部不可信站点作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032894","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-065","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2419","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44743","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2419.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4c8bc08999fabe8b3294f538c2b18b89d913b674/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2419.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2419","https://github.com/smgorelik/Windows-RCE-exploits/blob/98a7eeccfc070b74c617a33a716cfea6f90f70c8/Web/Javascript/README.md","https://github.com/ctxis/CAPE/blob/dae9fa6a254ecdbabeb7eb0d2389fa63722c1e82/modules/signatures/cve_2015_2419.py","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-2419/README_KO.md","https://github.com/cwbae10-purdue/CTI-EACL24/blob/5990586483b6ba4c7e6eef0ddb1c3698a740308b/threat-reports-large/fireeye/data/511_cve-2015-2419_inte.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-2419.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-2419.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/SSVC/data/2015/CVE-2015-2419.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0600","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-5122","title":"Adobe Flash Player及AIR 内存错误引用任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player及AIR中的DisplayObject类存在使用后释放（use-after-free）漏洞，源于ActionScript 3（AS3）实现对opaqueBackground属性处理不当。攻击者可构造恶意Flash内容触发内存损坏，在目标系统上执行任意代码或导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响Windows、OS X及Linux平台上的Adobe Flash Player多个版本（13.x至18.x），CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。此漏洞曾被野外攻击利用，Metasploit框架已提供公开PoC。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-5122"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-07-14T10:59:00.213","updated":"2026-06-17T00:28:30.877","remediation":"立即将 Adobe Flash Player 升级至 18.0.0.232 或更高版本，该版本修复了 opaqueBackground 属性处理中的 use-after-free 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件（chrome://plugins 中禁用 Flash），或通过组策略/注册表禁用 Flash 内容自动播放，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-07/msg00028.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-07/msg00029.html","http://lists.opensuse.org