VE-2015-5119","https://github.com/RandomRhythm/YARA_Rules_Project_Sorted_Ruleset/blob/81d9e1fd3a194e95ff8b043784441b4e6e914ab1/cve_rules/swf/CVE-2015-5119_swf.yar","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/0x0be/PEpper/blob/9dfcade04b41422b5c8457956f984cd25fe3e6d2/rules/CVE_Rules_index.yar","https://github.com/w8mej/InfoSec-Blueprints/blob/55a18c7896d5b66e64601550e462ce3e75824a16/conf/yara/CVE-2015-5119.yar","https://github.com/swimlane/soc-faker/blob/361c4ae88956878fbd8aaf5975044328556dfecd/socfaker/data/alert_names.txt","https://github.com/CiscoCXSecurity/CVE-2015-5119_walkthrough","https://github.com/jvazquez-r7/CVE-2015-5119","https://github.com/dangokyo/CVE-2015-5119","https://github.com/Xattam1/Adobe-Flash-Exploits_17-18"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0555.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0555.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0500","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-3113","title":"Adobe Flash Player 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CVE-2015-3113），源于 Nellymoser 音频解码器处理特制音频数据时未正确校验缓冲区边界，导致越界写入。攻击者可构造恶意 Flash 内容（SWF），诱导受害者访问含恶意 Flash 的网页，触发堆溢出实现远程代码执行。漏洞影响 Windows/OS X 上 13.0.0.296 之前版本、14.x 至 18.x 18.0.0.194 之前版本，以及 Linux 上 11.2.202.468 之前版本。CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击向量为网络（AV:N）、低复杂度（AC:L）、无需权限（PR:N）、无需用户交互（UI:N），2015 年 6 月已在野利用。Adobe 已于 2015 年 6 月发布安全更新修复该漏洞（APSB15-11），CVE 编号 CVE-2015-3113，CWE 编号 CWE-787/CWE-122。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-3113"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-06-23T21:59:01.960","updated":"2026-06-17T00:25:19.230","remediation":"立即卸载所有系统上的 Adobe Flash Player（Windows/macOS/Linux），Adobe 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日停止支持且不再提供安全更新。Windows 可通过「控制面板→程序和功能→卸载 Adobe Flash Player」或运行官方卸载工具；macOS 运行官方卸载脚本；Linux 使用包管理器卸载 flashplugin-nonfree 或 adobe-flashplugin。浏览器中彻底禁用 Flash 插件（Chrome: chrome://settings/content/flash 设为「阻止」；Firefox: about:addons 禁用 Shockwave Flash；Edge: edge://settings/content/flash 关闭）。若存在必须运行的旧版 Flash 应用，务必将其隔离在无网络访问的离线虚拟机中运行，严禁联网。不可继续使用任何版本的 Flash Player，包括最后版本 32.0.0.465，均存在已知未修复漏洞。建议迁移至 HTML5/WebAssembly 等现代替代技术。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-06/msg00020.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-06/msg00025.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-07/msg00002.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=144050155601375&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-1184.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75371","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032696","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1235036","https://bugzilla.suse.com/show_bug.cgi?id=935701","https://h20564.www2.hpe.com/portal/site/hpsc/public/kb/docDisplay?docId=emr_na-c04952467","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb15-14.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201507-13","https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2015-3113.html","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-3113","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37536","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-3113.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a257431e220101b25f51c7e22239ee65d73c4dbf/2015/3xxx/CVE-2015-3113.json","https://github.com/EmergingThreats/et-luajit-scripts/blob/109d050f5593e629311d0ca92d3200f59d57a7c8/CVE-2015-3113.lua","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_adobe-fixed-cve-2015-3113.html.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-3113","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-3113-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-3113/README.md","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/88%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/23847.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0029","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-3897","title":"Bonita BPM Portal 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Bonita BPM Portal 6.5.3 之前版本中存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 bonita/portal/themeResource 接口发送特制请求，在 theme 参数中使用 ../ 路径穿越序列并在 location 参数中指定目标文件路径，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞仅影响机密性，攻击复杂度低，利用方式简单，已有公开 PoC 和利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-3897"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-06-18T18:59:01.303","updated":"2026-06-17T00:26:28.037","remediation":"将 Bonita BPM Portal 升级至 6.5.3 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面配置访问规则，限制对 `/bonita/portal/themeResource` 路径的 `theme` 和 `location` 参数中 `../` 序列的传入，或通过 WAF 规则拦截路径遍历攻击载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132237/Bonita-BPM-6.5.1-Directory-Traversal-Open-Redirect.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/535733/100/0/threaded","https://www.htbridge.com/advisory/HTB23259","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3897.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-3897.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-3897.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2015/3xxx/CVE-2015-3897.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-3897-2521.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2015-3897-2518.yaml","https://github.com/Akokonunes/Private-Nuclei-Templates/blob/f92d2274458a958ed01345915693cf1dbe026f83/LFI/CVE-2015-3897.yaml","https://github.com/kozlm/Scanropod/blob/e836c2bacd6b42482f56e0ef0bd2f29467a45958/config/cwe-lists/nuclei-csv.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2015/CVE-2015-3897.md","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Jan/15/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2015-3897-2519.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0036","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4414","title":"WordPress SE HTML5 Album Audio Player 目录遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress SE HTML5 Album Audio Player 插件 1.1.0 及更早版本中的 `download_audio.php` 文件存在目录遍历漏洞。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向 `file` 参数传递 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过目录限制读取服务器上任意文件（如 `/etc/passwd`、`wp-config.php` 等敏感文件）。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可触发，可能导致网站配置信息、数据库凭证等敏感数据泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4414"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-06-17T18:59:08.407","updated":"2026-06-17T00:27:15.047","remediation":"立即删除 se-html5-album-audio-player 插件，该插件已于 2013 年从 WordPress 官方仓库下架且不再维护，无法通过升级修复。删除路径：WordPress 后台 → 插件 → 已安装插件 → 找到 SE HTML5 Album Audio Player → 点击「删除」。如因业务需要暂时保留，可在网站根目录 .htaccess 中添加规则：`RewriteRule ^wp-content/plugins/se-html5-album-audio-player/download_audio\\.php - [F,L]` 以阻断对 download_audio.php 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132266/WordPress-SE-HTML5-Album-Audio-Player-1.1.0-Directory-Traversal.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75093","http://www.vapid.dhs.org/advisory.php?v=124","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8032","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37274/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37274","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4414.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-4414.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4414.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-4414/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-4414.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2015-4414-2528.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-4414-se_html5_album_audio_player-fbdd01b3-153b-4783-b686-558874d2856e_1.yaml","https://github.com/kaaangumus/montana-framework/blob/3ea18a1311093d6fbcac3abbe2cfdfc780921b81/exploits/web-applications/23739.txt","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2015-4414-2527.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Jan/22/Reports/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-4414_3.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/C